WEBVTT

00:20.200 --> 00:26.400
During the day I saw these two standing on Yiyang's city walls they're not enemies you two.

00:26.480 --> 00:28.480
Why are you dressed like this?

00:31.400 --> 00:36.720
Confidential I understand I am the commander liu Dadao's granddaughter I'm Liu Nian.

00:36.800 --> 00:39.400
This is Uncle Qiu grandfather's capable deputy.

00:41.760 --> 00:48.040
Yiyang garrison deputy general Xie Xuan by my general's orders come to discuss with General Liu the matter of volunteers entering in groups.

00:48.120 --> 00:49.520
Specific details.

00:50.640 --> 00:53.520
Follow me I'll take you to see grandfather.

01:04.320 --> 01:09.160
Those two one of them said he's the Yiyang garrison deputy general the other didn't mention.

01:09.240 --> 01:12.080
But I think something's off what's off?

01:12.160 --> 01:15.400
Didn't I treat everyone's frostbite on hands and feet?

01:15.560 --> 01:19.640
His hands look different from ours what?

01:19.720 --> 01:21.200
He has six fingers.

01:34.640 --> 01:39.240
Your general pays respects to Prince of Jin grandfather.

01:43.520 --> 01:48.880
Pay respects to Your Highness Commander Liu why would I need to hide.

01:48.960 --> 01:50.360
To come out and see you?

01:50.440 --> 01:56.000
Do you understand this this in the volunteer army there are many eyes.

01:56.080 --> 02:00.760
A force of nearly ten thousand can you guarantee you know each person's background?

02:01.960 --> 02:07.200
In this volunteer army there's more than just my group everyone just came together temporarily so.

02:07.280 --> 02:09.613
I cannot let you into the city.

02:11.560 --> 02:15.360
If in the volunteer army there are Wuzhao spies taking advantage of the chaos.

02:17.080 --> 02:22.720
The northern expedition fails liu Dadao you who came from afar noble volunteers.

02:22.800 --> 02:24.467
Will all become eternal sinners.

02:25.520 --> 02:27.640
Your Highness this.

02:31.040 --> 02:37.200
I naturally trust Commander Liu but I'm also afraid Commander Liu will misunderstand my intentions that's why I specifically risked.

02:37.280 --> 02:41.800
Hiding my identity to explain to Commander Liu and discuss a solution.

02:46.280 --> 02:47.680
Rise.

03:20.600 --> 03:24.960
Your Highness's concerns I understand but Your Highness says.

03:25.040 --> 03:29.120
There may be spies among my brothers what's the evidence?

